'''Baby Long Legs''' quickly run away from Isaac and occasionally stops to spawn a {{E|Spider}}. Usually, they can spawn a maximum of 3 Spiders. They run around erratically when Isaac is nearby and can sometimes run directly into him when this occurs.
{{clear}}

== Variants ==
=== Small Baby Long Legs ===
