The '''Small Baby Long Legs''' is a tiny variant of Baby Long Legs that simultaneously spawns {{E|Sack}}s along with a small puddle of slowing [[Creep#White Creep|White Creep]]. The Sacks it spawns start at around half health and take a while to regenerate fully.
{{clear}}

